{"synopsis":"Han Wu berpindah ke dunia di mana setiap orang bisa menjadi Dewa. Dia memperoleh kemampuan untuk mengorbankan nyawa. Pada awalnya, dia berasal dari klan sampah, jadi dia berkorban untuk mengubah nasibnya melawan langit. Tanpa kekuatan, status, dan uang, dia mengorbankan apapun demi menuju puncak. Selama dia memiliki cukup pengikut, dia bisa menjadi jauh lebih kuat melalui pengorbanan, menjadi Dewa utama, Dewanya para Dewa!","alternative_title":"全民神祇：我献祭亿万生灵成神, Spirit Sacrifice: The Path to Godhood, Everyone Is a King: I Sacrifice Countless Lives to Become a King","author":"触手漫画工作室","artist":"触手漫画工作室","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"92fdf416-4c20-4797-acf1-dd80b96bccc2","number":"95","chapter":"95","title":"Chapter 95","date":"2025-12-16","released":"2025-12-16","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ea5cf59b-8b74-4974-bcb2-e58b652c0776","number":"94","chapter":"94","title":"Chapter 94","date":"2025-12-09","released":"2025-12-09","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"97ff88f8-94a8-4f65-b368-85d69691c977","number":"93","chapter":"93","title":"Chapter 93","date":"2025-12-02","released":"2025-12-02","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"2d2bd79c-90a2-41a4-916e-56b2b0ae9b89","number":"92","chapter":"92","title":"Chapter 92","date":"2025-12-02","released":"2025-12-02","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"65857329-3229-4eb3-8191-cb1db2e8c1a4","number":"91","chapter":"91","title":"Chapter 91","date":"2025-11-18","released":"2025-11-18","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"99f659b0-943e-40a2-ae78-32418e7fac1f","number":"90","chapter":"90","title":"Chapter 90","date":"2025-11-12","released":"2025-11-12","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"2f4431fc-a8c9-4040-b0c6-5fec1f16b6de","number":"89","chapter":"89","title":"Chapter 89","date":"2025-11-04","released":"2025-11-04","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"1e30d573-3ed5-40da-8995-7ae02b918519","number":"88","chapter":"88","title":"Chapter 88","date":"2025-10-28","released":"2025-10-28","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"57084876-8a90-4997-8287-6c925190721e","number":"87","chapter":"87","titl